### Static assets (served from OSS/CDN, not committed) ###
# 运行时图片素材不入库：本机开发时文件照常放在这些目录，但 git 不跟踪，
# 新克隆需从 OSS/CDN 拉取，或按 design-sources/README.md 重新导出
src/main/resources/static/assets/frogs/*.png
src/main/resources/static/assets/frogs/components/
src/main/resources/static/assets/sources/

### 部署产物（含业务数据快照，不入库） ###
deploy/db/*.sql
deploy/app.jar
deploy/.env
